<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
<%- include('../partials/page-hero', {
  kicker: 'About',
  heading: 'A hosting company<br><span class="hl">run by people who use it</span>',
  sub: 'Vesopa Cloud is part of Vesopa EPOS Ltd — a Welsh software company that has run its own servers since 2018, because we needed hosting we could trust for our own customers first.',
}) %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <div data-reveal="0">
      <p class="lede">
        We build and run Vesopa EPOS: till software used in restaurants, cafés and
        takeaways across the UK. That business depends on servers being up at
        seven on a Friday evening, so we learned to run infrastructure properly
        long before we sold any of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Hosting came out of a repeated conversation. A venue would ask who does
        their website, and the answer was some reseller charging forty pounds a
        year for an SSL certificate that is free, on a control panel designed in
        2003, with support that closes at five. We could do better than that with
        the servers we already had.
      </p>
      <p>
        So the product is deliberately narrow. Shared hosting, domains and email,
        done well, on a panel we wrote ourselves. No VPS range, no reseller tier,
        no upsell funnel. If you need something we do not do, we will say so and
        point you at someone who does.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div class="grid grid-2" data-reveal="60">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="f-icon"><%- icon('server', 22) %></div>
        <h2 class="h3 mb-2">Where your site actually lives</h2>
        <p class="small muted mb-0">
          Ubuntu 24.04 LTS on Microsoft Azure, in a UK region. Every account is an
          isolated system user with its own quota. We run the same stack for our
          own production systems, which is the only endorsement that means much.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="f-icon"><%- icon('headset', 22) %></div>
        <h2 class="h3 mb-2">Who answers your ticket</h2>
        <p class="small muted mb-0">
          Someone in the UK who can read a server log and change a config. We are
          a small team, so you will get the same few names — which also means we
          remember your site the second time you write.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h1 center mb-4" data-reveal="0">What we will not do</h2>
    <div class="grid" style="gap:14px" data-reveal="40">
      <% [
        ['Sell you something free', 'SSL is included. So is WHOIS privacy where the registry allows it. If we ever charge for one of those, something has gone wrong here.'],
        ['Hide the renewal price', 'It is printed on the plan before you buy and it does not move. The industry standard of a cheap first year and a doubled second is a trick, not a business model.'],
        ['Make leaving difficult', 'Unlock the domain, get the code, go. No fee, no retention call, no seven-day wait we invented.'],
        ['Oversell the hardware', 'There is a real limit to how many accounts go on a node and we hold to it. "Unlimited" everything on a shared server means everyone is slow at the same time.'],
      ].forEach(function (s) { %>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
            <span style="color:var(--lime-ink);flex:none;margin-top:2px"><%- icon('check-circle', 20) %></span>
            <div><div class="strong"><%= s[0] %></div><div class="small muted"><%= s[1] %></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2 class="h2 mb-2" data-reveal="0">Company details</h2>
    <p class="muted mb-3" data-reveal="40">
      <%= contact.company %> · <%= contact.address_line1 %>, <%= contact.address_line2 %><br>
      <a href="mailto:<%= contact.email %>"><%= contact.email %></a> · <%= contact.phone %>
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="/contact" data-reveal="80">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
